<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Iphisithek</para>
  <para style="toc1">IPHISITHEK shii Phaul re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iphisithek</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iphi</para>
  <para style="mt1">IPHISITHEK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Phaul è Iphisianthek shii jigigam zey pha ji ne igobi shii zab ò um ro Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab hamangkhung nane sohnyiak, rog shii Masi yi khrug rek pha zab zen shii ò yie pha phak, (1:10) Hamangkhung-aphuii bran ne Isu Masi rog shii ò rek pha boh phak pha ji shii rai chiid phro ne khung.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iphisianthek pha igobi pha ithua shii, zeypho è Hamangkhung-aphuii awai è gua pha branthek shii yao pha lumuii ò chiang shii igobi rey yi, nyie khi-èrek ne ithek ne Dufuii Isu Masi è khung ne ithek ro layog shii ichad rey pha ji ro chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii pha boh sbang ne Ragung So shii ne zab rey mua pha ji ro. Nyichiieng pha ithua shii ne ai è thampho shii sieng pha lumuii ne Masi rog shii ò rek pha ji è airo izai chai shii ò rey pha khung.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bajo ò re-è yao pha ò shii khoh ne Hamangkhung-aphuii bran ne Masi rog shii ò rek bo ne doh yi: charch ne siu duiine ro, ai khrug ne Masi ro; dinne hò duiine ro, ai rog shii Masi ne iring pha lubao ro; dinne yiy duiine, ai rog shii Masi ne gey duiine ro. Hì pha jigigam ne zeypho è Masi shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha bushun ne phi rone bajo giu yao ro. Zab khlem, khungphi, bushun, nane gang ne Masi ro miie muchuang shii doh ro.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi nane charch <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi shii iwo chai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jong sha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Phaul re-è, hanyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii è yang pha Masi Isu ro guaphasamoy—</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Iphisus hà Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bran pha hanyie è ithek ro chai ne Isu Masi rog shii ò migi rek ro:<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii gathek ro Aphuii nane Ithong Isu Masi è nathek shii bushun nane liijiing phi bo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi hà luruak pha khirzeythek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Cho gethek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Ithong Isu Masi Aphuii shii laso phi haro! Chiih-è gethek ne ò Masi rog pha ji re-è aine gethek shii hamangkhung pha sohjambling shii zab pha Ragung khirzey gethek shii phi ro. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Sohjambling rab pha ibi è rang de, gethek ro Masi rog shii ò pha ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek shii guajong ro, ji-è gethek ne ai ibi shii ichiig arek pha gang rek chid.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Nyieliieshii airo miie <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ne awairo Dufuii rab pha rone Isu Masi chiang è khuchung mujo gethek shii guajong ro, hì ne awai è sang pha awai blia rek pha rab phi. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Cho gethek ne airo biisiie pha bushun shii chiong rai haro, thaluii pha lasen shii ai è awairo bushun Dufuii shii phi muii! <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Masi ifai chiang è gethek shii ichad rek phi, jine gethek ro layog ne khung ge ro. Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne bajo boh ro, <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>nyie yi ai è bajoboh chua ne phi pha ji ro!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Ai è izai gethek shii awairo zab khani nane gao pha ji ne <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>ai è nyie yang pha ji Hamangkhung-aphuii è rek phi, chiih-è Masi Isu chiang è zab ug ne phakjong pha ji gethek shii thieg yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Hì pha phak ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab rek pha khriig ishak thok mage shii, zab hamangkhung pha nane zab sohnyiak pha rab pha ji shii ò jia shii yie pha, ai rog shii ne Masi ne khrug ro. <verse eid="EPH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Zab ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro phak duiine rek ro; chiih-è Masi rog ò rey yi pha Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek shii gua ro, ai igobi è nyie phak pha ji è gua ro, nyieliieshii awai blia rek yi pha gua ro. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Chiihphado cho gethek hanyie è dohbi Masi shii luthong pha ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biisiie pha ji shii chiong haro! <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Na è izai mua ji yoi mage shii, na de Hamangkhung-aphuii pha bran nyarey mua ruii phro, ji pha Mua Wie ji è na shii giawo yie ruii phro. Na de Masi shii migi rek bo! Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii awai è sbang rek muii pha Ragung So ji è nathek shii ai ne muspho ro ne nab phi phro. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è awairo branthek shii sbang nyie rek pha ji ne gethek shii mua ruii phro ne ibi è Ragung So ne phijong ro, chiih-è hì ne gethek shii phi phro ne, Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie awairo shii ne zab ichad rek phi ruii phro ne zai yaodang ro. Ji-è cho gethek ne airo biisiie pha ji shii chiong rai haro!<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phaul ro misia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Hì pha chiang, gu nyayoi dang ne nathek migi Ithong Isu shii um ne chiih-è nathek ro miie ne zab pha Hamangkhung-aphuii pha bran rog shii um pha ji, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Gu è nathek chiang shii Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi pha agak ro. Gu misia shii nathek shii nowkhlei phi, <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>chiih-è gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi ro Hamangkhung-aphuii biisiie pha Aphuii shii lia ro chiih-è ai è nathek shii Ragung phi bo chiih-è Ragung nathek shiine nathek shii khani phi ne Hamangkhung-aphuii dong yi, ji-è nathek de aishii ìd ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Nathek shii de airo muchuang ji riig yi pha gu è nathek ro khani hong phi bo ne lia, ji-è nathek shii ai è ho pha nyie luthong ji ne thieg ruii chiih-è awai bran shii sbang rek pha khama pha anomuluii pha khirzeythek thieg ruii phro, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>chiih-è hanyie è migi rek pho gethek shii ai è awairo riichaiboh chua ne khama blia rek ro ne thieg ruii phro. Gethek shii blia rek pha hì pha blu ne bajo chua ne ò ro, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>ji pha blu è khoh pha ji ai è Masi shii iy pha ji è hòi din chiih-è hamangkhung pha sohjambling hà aishii awai phazoi hà dug yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Masi ne riichaithek, bluthek nane Ithongthek chiih-è zab pha hamangkhung pha bohkhohthek pha ji shii de khoh ro; ai ne ichiih sohkhung pha riichaithek nane dinpha riichai ibeng shii è de zab è boh ibeng ba ro. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab pha manathek ne Masi lai iliing shii ruii ne chiih-è zab pha mana shii Ithong rab srane charch shii phi muii. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Charch ne Masi ro siu ro, charch è ne aishii jong phi ro, chiih-è ai ne zab pha ithua shii zab pha manathek shii ley ro.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Iy pha ji re-è sieng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Ibi hà nathek ne luruak shii iy dun, nyieliieshii nathek è anuii pha ji è layogthek rey dun. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Jipha ishak shii nathek ne sohjambling pha awie pha lumuii shii nuii ne lua; chiih-è nathek ne hamang hà ragung pha bluthek pha khohpho, ragung shii nuii, thuh shii ji pha ragung ne bran hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii anuii pho shii khoh ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Zai shii ne zab gethek de ithek duiine ro chiih-è gethek ro tharothamang pha ziig ji duiine rai. Chiih-è gethek ro siu nane khani è nyie chiid pha ji duiine gu è rek. Gethek ro ziig è gethek de zabthek duiine Hamangkhung-aphuii ro lijieg pha diig ji mua ruii phro ne phakjong.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Jimagungde Hamangkhung-aphuii pha bushun ne bajo ro, chiih-è ai è gethek shii miie pha ji ne boh ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Gethek anuii pha ji è ji pha ishak shii gethek luruak ne iy dun shii, ai è Masi rog shii sieng yi. Hìne Hamangkhung-aphuii bushun è gethek ne ragia rey ge ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Gethek Masi Isu rog ò pha ji è ai è gethek shii Masi rog hòi phi ne ai rog hamangkhung pha sohjambling shii khoh yi. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Ai è ji rek pha ji ne airo bushun pha bajoboh ne zab Ishak thog shii doh yi pha Masi Isu hà aì è miie shii gethek shii doh yi. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8-9"/>Chiih-è hì ne Hamangkhung-aphuii bushun è nathek ro migi ji è ragia rey ge ro. Hì ne nawaithek musnak è ragia arey ro, Jimagungde Hamangkhung-aphuii pha lasen ro. Ji-è hanyie de ji pha chiang shii nyigodog arek mua phro. <verse eid="EPH 2:8-9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Gethek ne nyie khi-èrek ne um pha ji Hamangkhung-aphuii awai è rab phi, chiih-è gethek ro Masi Isu rog shii ò pha ji è ai è gethek nyie rek yi pha saro ne ruiijong pha ji ne gethek shii wie blia rek pha chai rab phi.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu shii ne jia bie ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Nathek Gaibranthek nyagiak dang ne “Migiang-akheg” pho rone yao, Jewthek è awaithek shii migiangkheg pho rone yao, (branthek è awaithek siuthek rek yi) chiih-è nane igobi nyie ga ji nowkhlei bo. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Jipha ishak shii nathek ne Masi re-è yo rey dun ro. Nathek ne gai branthek ro chiih-è nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è gua pha bran è asi ro. Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai branthek shii sbang rek pha shiinyie shii ne nathek ne mathang oi ro, chiih-è nathek ne ichiih sohkhung shii luthong oi ro chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii de oi pha rai ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Jimagungde thuh shii, Masi Isu rog shii ò pha ji è chiih-è hanyie nathek è ruang rek pho shii Masi iy ne zid pha ji è inui hà noh ge ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Chiih-è Masi Gaibranthek nane Jewthek shii ò jia rab phi ne awai è gathek shii liijiing yi phi ro. Nathek shii yo rek ne mak rek ne ruii pha muthua shii awai siu è chuak muii ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Nyieliieshii jadthek bran nyi shii bran iwo jia rey yi ne awaithek chung ò rek yi pha, ai è Jewthek ro Iphey rog muyungthek nane khohthek pha ji shii sad muii ro, hì duiine liijiing rab phi ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Ai è bai shii iy pha ji è Masi è ithek ro suang shii srobro rek muii ro, bai pha miyaosiuthek ji è jad nyi shii siu ò jia rab ne Hamangkhung-aphuii hà iidoh noh ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Ji-è Masi wuiithok srane Hamangkhung-aphuii è ruang rey ne Gaibranthek nathek zab, chiih-è Jewthek, hanyie ai moe shii um pho thek zab shii liijiing pha Mua Wie yua ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Hì ne Masi chiang è gethek zab, Jewthek nane Gaibranthek ne, Aphuii moe pha Ragung jia shii wuii mua ro.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Ji-è Gaibran nathek ne fuangbranthek nane gai branthek asi sha ro; nathek ne thuh shii Hamangkhung-aphuii pha bran ijak ro chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii pha haliing sha ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Na shii ne guaphasamoy nane chaig pha sarong rung phi ro, iring pha lubao ne Masi Isu awairo. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ai ne jia ro hanyie è zab pha hò shii ò khoh ne rab chiih-è ug pha Jewthek misiahò ne Ithong shii sey re ro. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Masi Isu rog shii ò rek pha ji è na shii de zab pha gai rog shii Ragung è Hamangkhung-aphuii rai muii pha ji shii ò rung-ramuii ro.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Phaul è gaibranthek shii blia rek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Hì pha chiang è, gune, Phaul Gaibranthek nathek chiang gu ne Masi Isu pha phathegpho ro, gu ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sia. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Zai nathek ne yoi iwa, Hamangkhung-aphuii pha awairo bushun ne nathek shii wie rek phi pha blia ji gu shii phi ro. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è awairo ug pha phak ne gu shii thieg yi ro. (Gune hì pha chiang shii dum zeyjong bie ro, <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>chiih-è gu nyie zey pha ji nathek è tham arone gu è gao pha Masi ro ug muii pha ji ne nathek nyathieg mua ruii phro.) <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Igobi pha ishak shii hì ne bran shii ayao pha ug ne ruii, jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è thuh shii ne Ragung è so guaphasamoythek nane chaigthek shii dong phi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Ug pha ji ne hì ro mua miyaosiuthek ji è Gaibranthek de Hamangkhung-aphuii ro khirzey shii ithek de Jewthek rog mathang um ro; ithek de ò pha siu ro chiih-è Isu Masi chiang è rab muii pha Hamangkhung-aphuii ro sbang shii de mathang um ro.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bajowie pha lasen nyie ai è gu shii awairo blu phi ne blia rek yi pha chiang gune muawie pha khiao rab muii ro. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Gune Hamangkhung-aphuii pha bran duchoi shii zab è ìu rey dun ro; thuh shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è gu shii Masi ne ajong pha lasen mathang rone Gaibranthek shii Mua Wie ji yi phi pha jo phi ro. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ug pha phak ne nyie khi-èrek ne branthek shii blia rek rone doh yi ro, Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie ne zab pha manathek Rabpho è awairo ug pha phak jine buyo pho è ug ne ruii ne, <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Jiphachiang shii thuh pha ishak shii, hì pha miyaosiu ne charchthek re-è hamangkhung pha sohjambling pha bluthek hà hamangkhliie pha bohkhohthek è airo yoyo pha khani shii thieg yi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è ji duiine rek pha ji ne awairo idang pha blia shii rek, nyie jine ai è gethek ro Ithong Masi Isu è rek ge. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Masi rog shii ò pha ji nane gethek ro migi aishii um pha ji è gethek ne lububo rek ne chiih-è zab migi rek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii moe shii wuii mua ro. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Chiihphado gu nathek shii khung, lubu-ìu arek rabo nyieliieshii gu è nathek chiang diig rekjong ro; hìthek zab ne nathek shii phua pha ro.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi ro miie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Jiphachiang è gune Aphuii ibi shii lagiungthek niing, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>zab airo re-è hamangkhung pha haliing nane sohnyiak pha haliing pho ne izai ibeng choi ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Airo ragung è blu phi ne nathek ro iliing pha chai rek yi pha gu è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii airo biisiie pha ley ji lia ro, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>chiih-è gune sia phro Masi ne awairo hò ne migi ji è nathek lubu iliing shii rab bo, gune sia phro nathek shii ne iriingthek nane sarong um ne miie shii ò chuh rek mua. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Ji-è nathek ne zab Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bran rog Masi ro miie pha ji ne khama rei chiih-è khama phiang chiih-è khama giu nane khama jam ji thieg pha blu mua bo. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Nathek ne hì pha miie khuchung de zab ne athieg mua magunde nathek thieg ruii phro chiih-è ji-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ziig shii zab le bo.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Airo blu gethek shii blia rek pha ji ne gethek è lia muii pha ji è chiih-è now ji è de bajo rek mua: <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biisiie ne charch nane Masi Isu shii idang pha ishak um bo, chiih-è idang nane idang! Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Siu pha òjia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Chiihphado gu nathek shii khung, nyieliieshii gu è Ithong blia rek pha chiang è gu shii phatheg hà chab muii pha ji ro: Nathek shii ho pha ishak shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è phrai ne ruii pha ji shii ji duiine chai sieng bo. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Idang jum, mieng, nane zud rek bo. Nawaithek chung zud rai srane miie doh yi bo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Ragung è nathek shii liijiing è ò phang phi pha òjia shii ragia pha nawaithek ro wie ji rek bidiang bo. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Ichiih ne siu jia bie chiih-è Ragung jia bie ro. Ji duiine Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii ho pha luthong jia bie ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Ichiih ne Ithong jia bie ro, migi jia bie, khowo jia bie ro; <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Ichiih shii zab pha bran ro Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Aphuii ne jia bie ro, ai ne zab pha Ithong ro, zab re-è blia rek ne chiih-è zab shii um ro.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Gethek zab shii ne Masi è awai è yang ne nyie phi pha bajo wie lasen ji mua ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Jigigam shii yao pha duiine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Ai bajo giuthek hà wuii dun shii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Zum ne ruii pha bajo shii ai è ai rog noh dun ro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Ai è branthek shii lasenthek phi marui.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Thuh shii, ai laziung wuii dun rone yao pha miyaosiu jine nyie ga? Hì pha miyaosiu ne ai ne igobi sohnyiak pha bajo luii shii wuii marui ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Ji-è hanyie yi buzam wuii pha ji ne laziung, hamangkhungthek è de lakhung hà wuii dun ne airo um pha ji zab pha hamangnyiak rog shii zan dun ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Hìne ai hanyie branthek shii lasenthek phi muii pha ji ro;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 4:11">Ai è giak shii guaphasamoythek bow, giak shii chaigthek rab, giak shii Mua yua pho rab, chiih-è giak shii Phastharthek nane Masdothek rab. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Ai è ji rek pha ji ne Masipho ro blia rek yi pha zab pha Hamangkhung-aphuii bran shii saro phi, nyieliieshii Masi ro siu ji rung pha rek. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Chiih-è ji-è gethek ne migi ò shii rek srane chiih-è gethek khani ne Dufuii Hamangkhung-aphuii hà rek; gethek de bran weg rey ne, bajo giu Masi ro ley giu jihà thok ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Chiihphado, khasauthek è shau srane thelaithalai pha hasam khinrin pha bran miyao ji shii shau ne, hanyie è ithek ro thaluii pha briakthek ji è gai shii awie pha lumuii hà lua noh pha jihà ne gethek ne ani asi sha ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Jiphachiang shii, ragung pha miie è izai yao ne, gethek ne hanyie yi khrug Masi ro zab pha lumuii è sieng chid phro. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Ai phrai pha ji zab pha yoyo siu ichuathek ne ò shii rey ro, chiih-è zab pha rung ji è nyie phi pha rog shii zab pha siu ne ò rey bo. Ji-è zab yo ichua ji blia yi isiie è rek mage shii, zab siu ne sieng srane miie shii awailum ne rab dun.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi shii iwo chai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Chiihphado, Ithong beng è, gu nathek shii phriie phro: Migi-arekpho duiine asieng rabo, hanyie è nowthek yi pha ji ne adunmey pha ro <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>chiih-è hanyie khani yi igiia hà um lei ne. Ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è phi pha chai shii ne mathang oi ro, chiih-è ithek ne zab athieg pho nane lawasdai ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Ithek ro wo pha than pha ji ne zab san dun ro; ithek ne awaithek zia pha blia shii zab phi muii chiih-è zab pha awie pha manathek athung pha rek lumao ro.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Jithek ne nathek è Masi chiang dab pha ji asi ro! <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Nathek ne izai ai chiang yoijong iwa chiih-è airo luagiengpho duiine nathek ne izai Isu shii um pha ji de dabjong ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Nathek è sieng pha ihèg nyie shii sieng yi pha ji è nathek ro ihèg lajia pha ji è ruang rek bo, ihèg lajia pha khinrin ne chiid pha ji è srobro rekjong ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Nathek ro lubuthek nane khanithek ne jong pha iwo rab bo, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>nyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii mia ne zen ne awailum ne izai chai shii dong pha ji ne miang nane gang ro chiih-è ji pha iwo lajia shii guii bo.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Chiihphado, khlam pha ne oi sha ro! Zab ne airo ijak migipho shii izai yao bo, nyieliieshii gethek zab ne Isu siu shii ne ò pha bran ro. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Nathek lijieg arone, nathek ro lijieg ji è layog hà anoh yi rabo, chiih-è idang inai lijieg ne arai rabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Sakhathong shii chua aphi rabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Nathek riaopho arone, ariao sha pha gak bo chiih-è ji pha chiang shii, blia rek pha jao ne wiang ne awai chai shii isiie rai ne dusho shii nong phi bo. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Awie pha rey pha miyaogamthek ayao rabo, jimagungde ji è ne wie rey ne chiih-è nyie chiid pha ji phi pha ji shii rab pha miyaogamthek yao bie bo. Ji-è nathek nyie yao pha ji ne nathek shii nuiiphothek shii wie rey yi bo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Ragung So shii azo yi rabo; chiih-è nathek shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ne muspho rone Ragung è cheb rab ro, Zai yao dang Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii ichad rek phi pha Inai ne thok ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Nathek ro khowthek, lajia nane lijieg pha ji ne ruang rek muii bo. Din ne aziak sha pha chiih-è makhak-ariing, nyie shii magunde khiijai pha athan yi rabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Jiphachiang shii, jum rek ne gai shii bushun rek bo, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è Masi chiang nathek shii khung phi pha ji duiine gai jia shii khung phi bo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Muchuang shii sieng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii bushun ani nyarey dang shii nathek de ai duiine rey pha bidiang bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Nathek chai ne miie shii phrai bo, Masi è gethek shii miie ne awai chai gethek shii phi ne chiih-è rem now pha zid nane khlem ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sang yi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Nathek Hamangkhung-aphuii bran nyarey dang ne, siulao pha, dinne awie pha blia, dinne giichak pha ji ne ibeng yie pha nyie miyaosiuthek shii de rangsua oì ro. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Chiih-è nathek ne nyie yi zea, wie miyao shii suang chiih-è zea miyao akhoh rabo. Jiphachiang shii nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Nathek shii izai yao hanyie jia de siulao, dinne zea chiih-è giichak (Giichak ne jangbang sia pha duiine ro) Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Masi ro Sajathua pha mathang amua ruii phro.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Nathek shii gaithek è bi-ìe miyaogamthek yao ne akhin-arin yi rabo; hì ne nyieliieshii hì pha manathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro lijieg ne hanyie è aishii anuii pho shii thok ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Ji-è ji duiine pha branthek rog shii nyie de rek pha oi ro. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Nathek ne nawaithek shii igiia hà rai noh, jishii nathek Ithong ro bran rey pha iidoh shii nathek de muchuang hà rai pha branthek duiine rey bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Hì pha muchuang ne zab ichua pha bajo wie, giangthek nane izai shii bukho yamiing yi ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Ithong shii nyie khi-èrek ne nyuii yi pha nui pha bidiang bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Branthek è rek pha adunmey pha mana igiia è rey pha manathek è yo rai bo. Jishii, ithek shii igiia è muchuang hà noh bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>(Ithek è ug ne rek pha mana shii yao pha rangde izai hì ne bajo biwo ro.) <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Chiih-è zab pha mana shii fuang isang hà yie mage shii, chiihphado ithek ro izai ziig ne sang è dong khlei ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Chiih-è zab nyie yi sang dong khlei ruii pha jine muchuang rey ruii phro. Ji-è hì ne yaojong ro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Sieng mage bo” men pho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">chiih-è iy pha ji è hòi mage bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Chiih-è nathek lakhung shii Masi ne khlieng ruii phro.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Ji-è nathek khi-èrek ne sieng chiid pha ji ne gayiig bo. Athieg pha branthek duiine arai pha, jishii khua pha branthek duiine sieng bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Nashii zab nyie jo um pha ji shii wie pha khoh bo, nyieliieshii duchung ne awie pha inai ro. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Bi-ìe arey rabo, jishii Ithong è nashii nyie rek yi pha yang pha ji sow pha bidiang bo.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Phuii niing ne athiig rabo, jine nashii buii rek bie phro, ji phachiang shii, Ragung è ley bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Nawaithek chung chiong pha ibai pha miyaogamthek è ibai è chiih-è ug pha ibaithek è yao rai bo; Ithong shii ibai nane sthun bai srane nawaithek lubu rog shii chiong bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi beng re-è, Hamangkhung-aphuii Aphuii ro zab pha chiang shii idang laso phi bo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geythek nane yiythek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Nyieliieshii nathek Masi shii ilab rek rone, nawaithek chung phi rai bo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Yiythek, Ithong shii rek pha duiine nathek de geythek shii phi muii bo.<verse eid="EPH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Chiih-è Masi è charch lakhung shii riichai rek pha duiine geythek ne yiythek lakhung shii riichai nyarek mua. Chiih-è Masi awai siu ne charch shii ne awai è giawo rek ro. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Chiih-è ji-è charch re-è de Masi shii phi pha duiine yiy nawaithek de zab geythek shii phi muii bo.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Geythek de Masi è charch shii miie ne awairo chai phi pha duiine, nawaithek yiy shii miie bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Ai è hì rek pha ji ne kho è sud ne so rab pha iidoh shii airo miyaogam ji è charch shii Hamangkhung-aphuii shii zid pha rek srane <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>charch ne zab khie rab ne— igang nane ichiig oi rone doh yi, chiih-è izea oi rone ichum oi rone chiih-è nyie biidiie oi rone chiih-è khiiriig rek srane awaishii phi muii. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Hò-aphuiithek nawaithek siu shii miie pha duiine yiythek shii de miie bo. Hò-aphuii hanyie è yiy shii miie arone ai awai shii miie ara ro. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>(Gethek hanyie de gethek siu shii akhiijai phro, ji phachiang shii gethek ro siu shii ne wang ne chiih-è gethek è gethek siu shii gayiig rek, Masi è charch shii gayiig pha duiine; <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>nyieliieshii gethek ne airo siu pha bran ro.) <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Jigigam shii yao, “Jipha chiang è gey ne awai aphuii amuii shii thoh ne yiy rog shii rai dun phro, chiih-è isa ne jia rey dun phro.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Ichiih shii bajo jam è ug ne ruii pha izai ne hì pha jigigam è dong ro, Masi nane charch shii rek pha ji ne nyie gu è thieg pha ji ro. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Jishii hì ne nathek shii de yao ro: Zab gey ne yiy shii nawai shii duiine miie bo, chiih-è zab yiythek ne gey shii ilab phi bo.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Aniphiing nane aphuii-amuiithek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Aniphiing, aphuii-amuii shii nuii phane nathek ro Masipho pha blia ro, chiih-è hì rek phane izai blia ro. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Nawaithek aphuii-amuiithek shii ilab phi pha ji” hìne igobi pha muyung Hamangkhung-aphuii sbang shii cho phi ro: <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Ji-è zab ne na rog shii wie wuii mua, chiih-è nane soh shii phiang ishak sieng ruii phro.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Amuii-aphuiithek, nawaithek aniphiing shii lijieg yi pha blia arek rabo. Jiphachiang shii, Masipho pha wie ji yua srane sieng yi bo.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khiaothek nane musphothek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Khiaothek, nawaithek tharothamang pha musphothek shii rum ne sam ne nuii bo; chiih-è nathek è Masi ro blia rek pha duiine, nawaithek lubu è izai rek bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Nathek shii riig pha blia ji arek bie rabo, nyieliieshii nathek ne nathek nuii pha ji yang pha now phro. Jimagungde Masi pha khiao duiine Hamangkhung-aphuii è nyie yang pha ji ne nawaithek lubu è rek bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Chiih-è bran shii arek bie pha, nawaithek blia ne Ithong shii rek pha duiine, chiih-è sang khiao duiine rek bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Nowkhlei bo hanyie è blia wie rek pha ji shii ne, Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek zab shii lasen phi ruii phro, khiao shii magungde chiih-è ichad shii magungde.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Muspho, hì duiine rek ne nawaithek khiaothek shii awie pha arek rabo. Nowkhlei bo khiao nathek ne hamangkhung hà hanyie è zab shii ò chua ruii pha muspho ne ò bie ro.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii pha zab mak pha yugiang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Idohhè, nawaithek chua ne Ithong rog shii ò rek ne chiih-è airo riichaiboh blu ji shii rab bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è phi pha zab suang pha yugiang ji guii bo, ji-è na ne Sakhathong ro awie pha briakthek suang ji è chuh rai mua phro. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Chiih-è gethek ne tharothamang è suang mak arek ro, jishii awie pha hamangkhung pha sohjambling shii bohkhohphothek, riichaithek, nane soh pha bluthek ji pha igiia sohjambling shii mak rek bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Ji-è thuh shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro mak pha yugiang guii bo! Ji-è awie pha inai thok mage shii, nathek ne suangpho è jo ji shii nyagieng mua phro; chiih-è iidohè thok pha mak rek pha idoh, nathek ne nawaithek ithua shii chuh rek ne riu ruii phro.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Ji-è nawai rinyie shii izai rathang riieng ne, chiih-è giang nane lubutho pha khug miak ne, saro ne riu bo, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>chiih-è nawai lakhia khia ne liijiing pha Mua Wie yao pha saro bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Idang pha ishak migi shii ne khug duiine han bo, chiihphado nathek ne zab pha Sakhathong ro hòi ne reg pha medthek ji shii ua mua. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Chiih-è giawo shii khuthung duiine thung bo, chiih-è Ragung è nathek shii phi pha khamriie duiine Hamangkhung-aphuii miyaogam shii de wad shii choi bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Hìthek zab ne misia rog shii rek ne, Hamangkhung-aphuii pha nong shii lia bo, chiih-è Ragung è noh dun pha duiine zab pha ishak shii sia bo. Jiphachiang è nowbthan ne khuchung magungde athoh rabo; Hamangkhung-aphuii pha branthek shii idang sia bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Gu yao pha saro mage shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è gu shii mua phi yi pha gu shii de sia mage bo. Ji-è gune ug ne ruii pha mua ji thieg yi pha lububo rek ne yao mua. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Hìpha mua chiang è gune khliie ro, jimagunde thuh shii gune phatheg hà um magunde. Gune mua shii lububo è yao chiid pha ji shii yao mua pha sia mage bo.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha salamthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Thaichikhus, Ithong pha blia shii gathek ro bushun khuiino nane isiie khiao è gu chiang pha mua zab phi pha ji yao ruii phro, Ji-è gu rog ne khi-èrek pha ji nathek ne thieg ruii phro. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Jiphachiang è gathek ne nyie khi-èrek reyramuii pha ji nane nathek shii lububo rek phi pha gune aishii nathek hà thoh ge ro. <verse eid="EPH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Aphuii nane Ithong Isu Masi è zab pha migipho shii liijiing nane migi rog pha miie ji phi bo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne zab hanyie è gathek Ithong Isu Masi rog pha miie ne khuchung de a-iy pha miie pho rog shii um bo.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
